flowchart TD
    A([STM32: 10ms Timer Tick]) --> B[Generate Dummy Telemetry]
    B --> C[Format into TelemetryPacket_t]
    C --> D[Load into SPI TX Buffer]
    D --> E[Toggle DATA_READY Pin 22 HIGH]
    E --> F{Wait for Jetson SPI Clock}

    H([Jetson: Detects Rising Edge]) --> I[Acknowledge Hardware IRQ]
    I --> J[Schedule Kernel Workqueue]
    J --> K[Pull SPI CS Low & Generate Clock]
    K --> F

    F --> L[SPI Shifts Data to Jetson]
    L --> M[Kernel Validates Magic Number]
    M -- Valid --> N[Push to kfifo Buffer]
    M -- Invalid --> O[Drop Frame & Log Error]
    N --> P[User-space reads /dev/telem0]
